        "generate": true,
        "transparent": false,
        "prompt": "Flat graphic background on a square canvas. A soft vertical gradient from warm golden yellow (this template: #F3C152) at the top edge fading to near-white by about 55% down. A large white dome/arch rises from the bottom center, almost as wide as the canvas; outside the arch, the two lower corners from about 60% down are filled with deep purple (this template: #6F079D). A full-width golden-yellow horizontal band at about 85–92% down, and a purple strip below it to the bottom edge. Three small dark-purple dots in a row near each top corner. Clean vector edges, soft even light. IMPORTANT: leave the lower-center of the frame (about 27–78% across, 30–100% down) empty of any person or other subject — that area is reserved for a separate transparent cutout composited on top; keep only background surface there. No text, lettering, logos or watermarks anywhere in the image.",
        "reference_url": "https://assets.quickhub.ai/qh-templates-2/education_training_19.png",
        "notes": "The headline (purple) and the kicker question (black) sit in the top band, about 13–87% across and 15–30% down, so the top of the gradient must stay light enough for dark text — never dark or busy, even for a moody brief. The footer contact line sits on a separate yellow band shape layer, not on this image. The reference photo has the person baked in; a fresh background must leave that area empty, because the cutout layer supplies the person and it must not be duplicated."
      },
